  << /ActualText (I\047m a UX\057UI designer who believes complexity isn\047t the problem confusion is\056 My work is removing the second while respecting the first\072 taking data\055heavy interfaces\054 dense workflows and multi\055device systems in enterprise environments and turning them into something people can actually move through\056 I pair user research with a clear read on business goals and technical constraints\054 so solutions hold up across real operational contexts and international audiences improving usability\054 onboarding and how confidently people act on what they see\056)
